Taken from the plain tokens of the existence rules in styles/ai-tells/. Left out: rules of other kinds, such as sequence rules; tokens written as regular expressions, which includes every rule marked nonword; rules scoped to headings or raw text; and eight rules whose phrases are ordinary wording in bug reports and docs (AnthropomorphicJustification, FigurativeQuantities, NarrativePivots, RedundantPrecaution, RestatementMarkers, SelfReference, SequencingMarkers and ServesAsDodge).
